{"id":"fbc69f55bbc322585511cc25b09ab440dd73d936","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231935","title":"DeepSeek flash 过度思考问题","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Younikes","excerpt":"程序员 - @Younikes - 为什么 deepseek flash 正式版的思考时间比原来长了很多很多，有的时候一个简单的任务能思考 2d 分钟，是我个人的问题吗，虽然 agent 能力的确 d 提升了 o 很多，但是这个过度思考","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/Younikes\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ae222404791ebb5f5ae31b88d06f87f?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"Younikes\" data-uid=\"453723\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/Younikes\">Younikes</a> · <span title=\"2026-08-04 10:53:23 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> via iPhone · 3534 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>为什么 deepseek flash 正式版的思考时间比原来长了很多很多，有的时候一个简单的任务能思考 2d 分钟，是我个人的问题吗，虽然 agent 能力的确 d 提升了 o 很多，但是这个过度思考有点烦</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935110\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6d2/40df/62082_normal.png?m=1782215192\" alt=\"zzutmebwd\" data-uid=\"62082\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zzutmebwd\">zzutmebwd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 10:55:01 +08:00\">21h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>deepseek flash 的官方 api 输出速度大概是多少？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935120\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 10:56:03 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我觉得面对复杂任务思考的还不够，所以只能执行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935141\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ae222404791ebb5f5ae31b88d06f87f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Younikes\" data-uid=\"453723\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Younikes\">Younikes</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 10:59:03 +08:00\">21h 38m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a> 我在我开发的一个 excel ai 侧边栏里面测试，以前让它美化下表格，速度很快，效果也不错，现在先思考很久我看了下思考内容，一堆 wait ，服了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935558\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b04b054c7c587105331657d67dcf6529?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"exmario\" data-uid=\"118707\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/exmario\">exmario</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:51:14 +08:00\">20h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>昨天和今天都遇到 503 ，体验真的差</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17936048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7f21/bc1b/365603_normal.png?m=1731906122\" alt=\"Wenlon\" data-uid=\"365603\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Wenlon\">Wenlon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 13:54:57 +08:00\">18h 42m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>flash 毕竟只是个 300B 不到的模型，moe 激活的只有 13B ，它必须依赖高强度思考才能制造局部稠密，从而实现超越参数规模的编码能力。目前看来参数规模、速度还有能力是个不可能三角</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17936110\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e8c4/cb10/380494_normal.png?m=1781252209\" alt=\"AlohaV2\" data-uid=\"380494\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AlohaV2\">AlohaV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 14:05:36 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是这样的。跟真人类似，如果不是特聪明的话要多思考几下。但如果最终能对也无妨，多花的时间可以用并发解决（约等于企业多招人）。毕竟参数量在这里。<br>所以还是期待 pro 能给到啥。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17936395\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0291c2435cb4647a2e032533b5357ff4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bbsingao\" data-uid=\"109292\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bbsingao\">bbsingao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 14:44:35 +08:00\">17h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这主要看你的 harness 是什么东西, codex 好些, cc 就更久</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17936794\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4261/9283/567145_normal.png?m=1662376858\" alt=\"JackCh3ng\" data-uid=\"567145\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JackCh3ng\">JackCh3ng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 15:37:03 +08:00\">17h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我有一个每天定时的任务，自从更新之后，任务没完全执行成功过，两次都是有部分任务执行失败，而且 token 花费 x4 了，今天准备把任务关了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a3c7/88c5/7498_normal.png?m=1335020271\" alt=\"limon\" data-uid=\"7498\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/limon\">limon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:13:12 +08:00\">16h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和 agent 有关，我用 grok 感觉明显快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937060\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8cb9/28e6/124590_normal.png?m=1539075573\" alt=\"maemolee\" data-uid=\"124590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maemolee\">maemolee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:18:54 +08:00\">16h 18m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我在 WorkBuddy 里接了最新的 dsv4f ，发一个“你好”，打断，再点一下重试，他能思考上千字……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937099\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/815f/9fae/187268_normal.png?m=1777124300\" alt=\"codehz\" data-uid=\"187268\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codehz\">codehz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:23:55 +08:00\">16h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>推理努力设置成 low ，然后自己编写需要推理的强度，，因为 high 和 max 就是提示词的差异，low 就是不给额外提示词，但允许推理的模式</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937287\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/86f8ac86127dfea9a65db17666113a2c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Bssn\" data-uid=\"474958\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Bssn\">Bssn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:52:11 +08:00\">15h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在 zcode 里挺好用的，推荐尝试</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937555\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/37098ed401a68b8aec1558bbb17f1d71?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HotieCutie\" data-uid=\"409676\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HotieCutie\">HotieCutie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:40:00 +08:00\">14h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>快和质量二者不可兼得，gpt 就是出奇的慢，但是质量确实不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937564\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:42:35 +08:00\">14h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>因为模型小就只能靠思维链来提升性能，对于小模型来说这种不叫“过度思考”，5.6 sol 的 max 那种才叫过度思考</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937577\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1cf3/a815/332504_normal.png?m=1765524039\" alt=\"glaucus\" data-uid=\"332504\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/glaucus\">glaucus</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:45:14 +08:00\">14h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我一直 503 ，我还以为 opencode 的问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938194\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd96/27b5/160446_normal.png?m=1718352966\" alt=\"as9567585\" data-uid=\"160446\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/as9567585\">as9567585</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 21:54:35 +08:00\">10h 42m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>很可能是 harness 内部的过度提示词的问题，我从 cc 切换到 pi ，体验好很多。cc 的作者也表示，最近的版本删除 80%的提示词。现在模型的智商确实提高了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938200\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ae222404791ebb5f5ae31b88d06f87f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Younikes\" data-uid=\"453723\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Younikes\">Younikes</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 21:57:09 +08:00\">10h 39m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/as9567585\">as9567585</a> 自己做的 excel 插件，从头写的极简 agent ，应该不是这个问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938292\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d303255c718e4e96486467e84cf0b400?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"brsyrockss\" data-uid=\"583134\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/brsyrockss\">brsyrockss</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 23:01:56 +08:00\">9h 35m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>你教小孩子做数学题,做的快了错的多,你给一巴掌,说为啥不检查,现在做的慢了,每个题都要检查一遍,正确率高了,你又给一巴掌,问:为啥要检查?<br>你咋这么难伺候</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"Younikes · 21h 43m ago via iPhone · 3534 views 为什么 deepseek flash 正式版的思考时间比原来长了很多很多，有的时候一个简单的任务能思考 2d 分钟，是我个人的问题吗，虽然 agent 能力的确 d 提升了 o 很多，但是这个过度思考有点烦 1 zzutmebwd 21h 42m ago deepseek flash 的官方 api 输出速度大概是多少？ 2 jko123 21h 41m ago 我觉得面对复杂任务思考的还不够，所以只能执行 3 Younikes OP 21h 38m ago via iPhone @jko123 我在我开发的一个 excel ai 侧边栏里面测试，以前让它美化下表格，速度很快，效果也不错，现在先思考很久我看了下思考内容，一堆 wait ，服了 5 exmario 20h 45m ago 昨天和今天都遇到 503 ，体验真的差 6 Wenlon 18h 42m ago 3 flash 毕竟只是个 300B 不到的模型，moe 激活的只有 13B ，它必须依赖高强度思考才能制造局部稠密，从而实现超越参数规模的编码能力。目前看来参数规模、速度还有能力是个不可能三角 7 AlohaV2 18h 31m ago 是这样的。跟真人类似，如果不是特聪明的话要多思考几下。但如果最终能对也无妨，多花的时间可以用并发解决（约等于企业多招人）。毕竟参数量在这里。所以还是期待 pro 能给到啥。 8 bbsingao 17h 52m ago 这主要看你的 harness 是什么东西, codex 好些, cc 就更久 11 JackCh3ng 17h 0m ago 我有一个每天定时的任务，自从更新之后，任务没完全执行成功过，两次都是有部分任务执行失败，而且 token 花费 x4 了，今天准备把任务关了。 12 limon 16h 23m ago 和 agent 有关，我用 grok 感觉明显快 13 maemolee 16h 18m ago 1 我在 WorkBuddy 里接了最新的 dsv4f ，发一个“你好”，打断，再点一下重试，他能思考上千字…… 14 codehz 16h 13m ago 推理努力设置成 low ，然后自己编写需要推理的强度，，因为 high 和 max 就是提示词的差异，low 就是不给额外提示词，但允许推理的模式 17 Bssn 15h 44m ago 在 zcode 里挺好用的，推荐尝试 19 HotieCutie 14h 57m ago 快和质量二者不可兼得，gpt 就是出奇的慢，但是质量确实不错 20 maolon 14h 54m ago 因为模型小就只能靠思维链来提升性能，对于小模型来说这种不叫“过度思考”，5.6 sol 的 max 那种才叫过度思考 21 glaucus 14h 51m ago 我一直 503 ，我还以为 opencode 的问题 22 as9567585 10h 42m ago 1 很可能是 harness 内部的过度提示词的问题，我从 cc 切换到 pi ，体验好很多。cc 的作者也表示，最近的版本删除 80%的提示词。现在模型的智商确实提高了 23 Younikes OP 10h 39m ago via iPhone @as9567585 自己做的 excel 插件，从头写的极简 agent ，应该不是这个问题 27 brsyrockss 9h 35m ago 1 你教小孩子做数学题,做的快了错的多,你给一巴掌,说为啥不检查,现在做的慢了,每个题都要检查一遍,正确率高了,你又给一巴掌,问:为啥要检查?你咋这么难伺候","fetched_at":"2026-08-05T00:37:53.535Z","ok":true}